  "conclusion": "One statement validates, diagnoses and digests a typed population with canonical bytes when struct fields are declared in sorted order, presence is explicit, and nine upper-case control escapes are rewritten. JSON reading is a lossy cast, not shape validation. Readers are single use and estimated at one row. The postgres extension shares one exported snapshot across parallel binary COPY scans, opens a connection per scan task and maps unconstrained numeric to DOUBLE by default. Its write path was not exercised.",
